{"schemaVersion":1,"id":308,"sections":[{"id":"607006-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20511],"start":0,"count":22},{"id":"607006-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20512],"start":22,"count":20}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:1","scriptId":20511,"text":"通过反复收集和兑换，不少小队都已经获得了一定的资源储备。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:2","scriptId":20511,"text":"“物资已经换到不少了，差不多是时候休息一下了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":19,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:3","scriptId":20511,"text":"“啧啧啧～这次既然是团长慷慨解囊，那我们怎么可以辜负她的好意呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:4","scriptId":20511,"text":"“那就再搞一个小时。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":673,"speaker":"多萝·雷德尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:5","scriptId":20511,"text":"“诶！？一个小时？跑不动了啦……我能不能也坐车上啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":673,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:6","scriptId":20511,"text":"“门都没有，好好锻炼，把你那身赘肉减掉点。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":673,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":673,"speaker":"多萝·雷德尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:7","scriptId":20511,"text":"“呜……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":673,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":644,"speaker":"玛鲁夏·德米特里耶夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:8","scriptId":20511,"text":"“哈哈，也就一个小时啦，多萝你就再忍一忍吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":644,"right":673,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:9","scriptId":20511,"text":"艾莉丝小队运气很好，从活动开始到现在，还没有碰到过其他小队的骚扰，旗帜收集进行地十分顺利。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":644,"right":673,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:10","scriptId":20511,"text":"“不是说小队间可以互相抢夺旗帜的吗？为什么我们一个队伍都没碰到啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":673,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":19,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:11","scriptId":20511,"text":"“场地那么大，要碰上其他小队也不是那么容易的事情啊，况且就算碰到了也未必一定要互相伤害啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:12","scriptId":20511,"text":"“话是这么说，不过总觉得这种活动还是加点火药味才好啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":19,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:13","scriptId":20511,"text":"“主人您也太——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:14","scriptId":20511,"text":"就在这时，突然听到了炮弹的爆炸声。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:17","scriptId":20511,"text":"“哦呀，是我们被攻击了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":19,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:18","scriptId":20511,"text":"“不，这爆炸声是从十点钟方向传过来的，那里可能正在进行战斗吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:19","scriptId":20511,"text":"“很好，那么我们也去凑个热闹～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":19,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:20","scriptId":20511,"text":"“但是现在我们手里已经收集了一些信号旗，不应该先交还掉吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:21","scriptId":20511,"text":"“错过战机可不好啊，说不定我们能渔翁得利呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:22","scriptId":20511,"text":"艾莉丝显得有些兴奋。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:23","scriptId":20511,"text":"“都做好战斗准备，说不定我们可以坐收渔翁之利。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":25,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-PROLOGUE:20511:24","scriptId":20511,"text":"“应该是趁火打劫才对吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-06.webp","left":8,"right":25,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:1","scriptId":20512,"text":"死水基地兑换处。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":8,"right":25,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:2","scriptId":20512,"text":"“总共是十二面信号旗，请问准备以何种组合来提交呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":25,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":19,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:3","scriptId":20512,"text":"“FOOD、PIXY……剩下的好像拼凑不出指定组合了呢，主人觉得呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":19,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:4","scriptId":20512,"text":"“那就这样吧，先换了这两个，其余的旗帜先收起来。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":8,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:5","scriptId":20512,"text":"“FOOD和PIXY，了解了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":8,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:6","scriptId":20512,"text":"芮蓓对信号旗进行确认并收了起来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":8,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:7","scriptId":20512,"text":"“这是对应的奖励，请收好。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":8,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:8","scriptId":20512,"text":"然后取出了两个箱子交给了莫夏。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":8,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":19,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:9","scriptId":20512,"text":"“谢谢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":19,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:10","scriptId":20512,"text":"莫夏很有礼貌地接过箱子。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":19,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":25,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:11","scriptId":20512,"text":"“如果不是主人要过去看热闹，我们明明可以换到更多物资呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":25,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:12","scriptId":20512,"text":"“切，谁能猜到多萝在关键的时刻摔了一跤，不然我的偷袭计划可是很完美的！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":8,"right":25,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:13","scriptId":20512,"text":"艾莉丝狠狠地瞪了躲在玛鲁夏身后的多萝。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":8,"right":25,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:14","scriptId":20512,"text":"由于多萝的失误，暴露了艾莉丝小队的行踪，最终演变成了三个小队的乱战。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":8,"right":25,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:15","scriptId":20512,"text":"因此艾莉丝她们也没捞到什么好处，就结果来看，还不如老老实实搜寻信号旗。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":8,"right":25,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":673,"speaker":"多萝·雷德尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:16","scriptId":20512,"text":"“对不起……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":8,"right":673,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":644,"speaker":"玛鲁夏·德米特里耶夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:17","scriptId":20512,"text":"“艾莉丝队长就不要那么耿耿于怀了啦，一开始就不应该指望多萝的~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":644,"right":673,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":19,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:18","scriptId":20512,"text":"“还有时间，再收集就好了呗。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":644,"right":19,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:19","scriptId":20512,"text":"“哼，这次要是再让我撞上那些家伙，我一定要把他们都拿下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":19,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607006-EPILOGUE:20512:20","scriptId":20512,"text":"“好啦好啦～知道了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":8,"right":19,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
